- specs/ contains unmodified copies of Adobe's specification files.
- reference/ is generated from those files by scripts/build_marketo_api_reference.py,
  which reformats them into Markdown pages and operation JSON files. Each
  generated section index names the specification it was generated from.
- postman/marketo-engage.postman_collection.json is generated from reference/
  by scripts/build_postman_collection.mjs, which turns each operation into a
  Postman request and includes Adobe's descriptions.

This product includes the Postman Collection Format v2.1.0 JSON Schema, from
https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json
